 *  CALCULATION DONE: (MAX THREADS = 10)             Thu Oct 15 13:14:08 2026  *
 *  GEO-OK     - OVERRIDE INTERATOMIC DISTANCE AND OTHER SAFETY CHECKS
 *  GEO_DAT    - DATA SET GEOMETRY IS IN FILE "Cyclobutadiene_1.arc"
 *  GEO_REF    - REFERENCE GEOMETRY IS IN FILE "Cyclobutadiene_2.arc"
 *               (NO BIAS TOWARDS THE REFERENCE GEOMETRY WILL BE APPLIED)
 *  OPT        - OPTIMIZE COORDINATES OF ALL ATOMS
 *  XYZ        - CARTESIAN COORDINATE SYSTEM TO BE USED
 *  LOCATE-TS  - LOCATE A TRANSITION STATE USING REACTANTS AND PRODUCTS
 *  T=         - A TIME OF 172800.0 SECONDS REQUESTED
 *  DUMP=N     - RESTART FILE WRITTEN EVERY 7200.0 SECONDS REQUESTED
 *  HTML       - WRITE HTML SCRIPT TO READ PDB FILE USING JSMOL
 *******************************************************************************
